{"title": "Inspect Moonlantern", "pageid": 42095, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Inspect_Moonlantern", "categories": ["Class actions", "Item summoning actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Inspect_Moonlantern.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Inspect_Moonlantern.webp/300px-Inspect_Moonlantern.webp, /w/images/e/e2/Inspect_Moonlantern.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Inspect_Moonlantern.webp/300px-Inspect_Moonlantern.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/Inspect_Moonlantern.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Inspect Moonlantern</b> is a class action granted by equipping the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moonlantern\" title=\"Moonlantern\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Moonlantern\" title=\"Moonlantern\">Moonlantern</a>. Using this action starts a conversation with <a href=\"/wiki/Dolly_Dolly_Dolly\" title=\"Dolly Dolly Dolly\">Dolly Dolly Dolly</a> imprisoned within the lantern. During the conversation, the party has the option of releasing her. This destroys the lantern, but Dolly Thrice rewards the party with the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell\" title=\"Filigreed Feywild Bell\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell\" title=\"Filigreed Feywild Bell\">Filigreed Feywild Bell</a>. If she is released by smashing the lantern, she will additionally curse the party member who did so with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_Clown_in_Town_(Condition)\" title=\"A Clown in Town (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/A_Clown_in_Town_Condition_Icon.png/20px-A_Clown_in_Town_Condition_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/A_Clown_in_Town_Condition_Icon.png/30px-A_Clown_in_Town_Condition_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/A_Clown_in_Town_Condition_Icon.png/40px-A_Clown_in_Town_Condition_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"A Clown in Town\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/A_Clown_in_Town_Condition_Icon.png/20px-A_Clown_in_Town_Condition_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/A_Clown_in_Town_Condition_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/A_Clown_in_Town_(Condition)\" title=\"A Clown in Town (Condition)\">A Clown in Town</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Looks like there is something inside the lantern. Inspect it closely.\n</p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_GLO_Pixie_InspectMoonlantern</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_GLO_Pixie_InspectMoonlantern\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_GLO_Pixie_InspectMoonlantern\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=ImmediateCast_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"ImmediateCast (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">ImmediateCast</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Item:_Filigreed_Feywild_Bell\"> Item: Filigreed Feywild Bell </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"nomobile\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_faded.png/180px-Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_faded.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_faded.png/270px-Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_faded.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_faded.png/360px-Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_faded.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_faded.png/180px-Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell\" title=\"Filigreed Feywild Bell\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/af/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell\" title=\"Filigreed Feywild Bell\">Filigreed Feywild Bell</a></span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-left: 20px\"><b>Effect</b>\n<p>Interact with the bell to speak with <a href=\"/wiki/Dolly_Dolly_Dolly\" title=\"Dolly Dolly Dolly\">Dolly Thrice</a>. Ask nicely and she will grant your party a permanent <sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\"><i>[<a href=\"/wiki/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell#Notes\" title=\"Filigreed Feywild Bell\">See Notes</a>]</i></sup> <a href=\"/wiki/Pixie_Blessing_(Condition)\" title=\"Pixie Blessing (Condition)\">Pixie Blessing</a>, which protects against the deepest pockets of the <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Curse (Condition)\">Shadow Curse</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-left: 20px\">\n<b>Properties</b><div class=\"bg3wiki-horizontlist\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Camp_Supplies_Icon.png/25px-Camp_Supplies_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Camp_Supplies_Icon.png/38px-Camp_Supplies_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Camp_Supplies_Icon.png/50px-Camp_Supplies_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Camp Supplies\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Camp_Supplies_Icon.png/25px-Camp_Supplies_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Camp_Supplies_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Supplies\" title=\"Camp Supplies\">Camp Supplies</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1           gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)</li></ul>\n</div> \n</div> \n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_A_Clown_in_Town\"> Condition: A Clown in Town </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_Clown_in_Town_(Condition)\" title=\"A Clown in Town (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/A_Clown_in_Town_Condition_Icon.png/30px-A_Clown_in_Town_Condition_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/A_Clown_in_Town_Condition_Icon.png/45px-A_Clown_in_Town_Condition_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/A_Clown_in_Town_Condition_Icon.png/60px-A_Clown_in_Town_Condition_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"A Clown in Town\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/A_Clown_in_Town_Condition_Icon.png/30px-A_Clown_in_Town_Condition_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/A_Clown_in_Town_Condition_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/A_Clown_in_Town_(Condition)\" title=\"A Clown in Town (Condition)\">A Clown in Town</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Rue the day you crossed a fey. You were cruel to <a href=\"/wiki/Dolly_Thrice\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dolly Thrice\">Dolly Thrice</a>; now you'll have to pay the price.</li>\n<li>This condition can only be obtained by smashing the <a href=\"/wiki/Moonlantern\" title=\"Moonlantern\">Moonlantern</a> held by <a href=\"/wiki/Kar%27niss\" title=\"Kar'niss\">Kar'niss</a>.</li>\n<li>Applies clown makeup to the victim.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moonlantern\" title=\"Moonlantern\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Moonlantern\" title=\"Moonlantern\">Moonlantern</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Inspecting the moon lantern and witnessing Dolly Dolly Dolly grants the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Artisan#Trust_and_a_Little_Pixie_Dust\" title=\"Guild Artisan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Trust and a Little Pixie Dust\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Artisan#Trust_and_a_Little_Pixie_Dust\" title=\"Guild Artisan\">Trust and a Little Pixie Dust</a> inspiration to party members with the <a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Artisan\" title=\"Guild Artisan\">Guild Artisan</a> background.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715043639\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.102 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.109 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4824/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 69052/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 28805/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 33/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 36/1000\nLua time usage: 0.038/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1376267/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n140.61%  134.807     61 Template:Trim\n100.00%   95.873      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   95.873      1 -total\n 22.16%   21.247      4 Template:Item_icon\n 20.46%   19.611      2 Template:SmRarityItem\n 18.97%   18.191      1 Template:Ite